{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-2379" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int x{(3-{x}^{2})}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2379" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "In this case, the $x$ that's outside the parentheses isn't quite the derivative of $(3-{x}^{2}).$ But the derivative is $-2x,$ so we're only out by a constant factor. \n\nSo we make the substitution\n\n$$\nu=3-{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nIts derivative is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =-2x\\,⟹\\,(-\\frac{1}{2})\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can now write our integral in terms of $u,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{(3-{x}^{2})}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {(3-{x}^{2})}^{5}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {u}^{5}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {u}^{5}\\,\\text{d}u\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can solve the integral in terms of $u$ and then write the final result in terms of $x.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {u}^{5}\\,\\text{d}u & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{6}}{6}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}{u}^{6}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}}{12}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2379" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a22b59dad43eb107694e22568974cb6332de9a01653ec17c32229aa5dc97b557"} {"question" "q-2379" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2379" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{5}}{5}+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}}{12}+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}}{6}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}}{6}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2379" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{{(3-{x}^{2})}^{6}}{12}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2389" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2389" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={x}^{3}+7.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{x}^{2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u={x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}}\\cdot {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{u}+C \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2389" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a22b59dad43eb107694e22568974cb6332de9a01653ec17c32229aa5dc97b557"} {"question" "q-2389" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2389" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}+C"] ["math" "2\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}}+C"] ["math" "\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-2389" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+7}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-49572" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int \\frac{{x}^{9}}{{x}^{10}+9}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-49572" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={x}^{10}+9.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=10{x}^{9}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{10}\\text{d}u={x}^{9}\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{x}^{9}}{{x}^{10}+9}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{10}+9}\\cdot {x}^{9}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{10}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{10}+9|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-49572" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a22b59dad43eb107694e22568974cb6332de9a01653ec17c32229aa5dc97b557"} {"question" "q-49572" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-49572" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "10\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{10}+9|+C"] ["math" "9\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{10}+9|+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{10}+9|+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{10}+9|+C"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{{({x}^{10}+9)}^{2}}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-49572" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{10}+9|+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-72566" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}-1}{{x}^{3}-x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-72566" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let $u={x}^{3}-x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{x}^{2}-1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=(3{x}^{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}-1}{{x}^{3}-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{3}-x}\\cdot (3{x}^{2}-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{3}-x|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-72566" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a22b59dad43eb107694e22568974cb6332de9a01653ec17c32229aa5dc97b557"} {"question" "q-72566" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-72566" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3{x}^{2}-1|+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3{x}^{2}-x|+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}-1}|+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{3}-1|+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{3}-x|+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-72566" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{x}^{3}-x|+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-113711" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int {x}^{6}(2+{x}^{7})^{2}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-113711" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "In this case, the term ${x}^{6}$ outside the parentheses isn't quite the derivative of $2+{x}^{7}.$ But the derivative is $7{x}^{6},$ so we're only out by a constant factor.\nSo we make the substitution\n\n$$\nu=2+{x}^{7}.\n$$\n\nIts derivative is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =7{x}^{6}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{7}\\text{d}u={x}^{6}\\,\\text{d}x,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can now write our integral in terms of $u,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{6}(2+{x}^{7})^{2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2+{x}^{7})^{2}\\cdot {x}^{6}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {u}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{7}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\int {u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can solve the integral in terms of $u$ and then write the final result in terms of $x.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{7}\\int {u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{3}}{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{21}{u}^{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{21}(2+{x}^{7})^{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{(2+{x}^{7})^{3}}{21}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-113711" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a22b59dad43eb107694e22568974cb6332de9a01653ec17c32229aa5dc97b557"} {"question" "q-113711" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8ab0110d95607fb968392cd9a6b739d0a8187c2"} {"question" "q-113711" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "21(2+{x}^{7})^{3}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2+{x}^{7})^{3}}{21}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2+{x}^{7})^{3}}{3}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2+{x}^{7})^{3}}{7}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{7(2+{x}^{7})^{3}}{3}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040764/state.json" "file_sha256" "dd168e9cb28b4644e65aa36eb8